# -O3 variant for the A/B comparison of the benchmark (docs/architecture/doc_kernel_build.md,
# section 7 gate 5 and section 13, item 2). build.sh --variant o3 merges it on top of
# kernel-local, replacing the lines with the same symbol; the buildid becomes .azoth.o3
# and the package is not published. Same format as kernel-local.

# The CachyOS -O3 option instead of the -O2 default chosen on 2026-09-05: two A/B runs
# on the same runner never saw it win beyond the noise. To be measured again when the
# toolchain or the series changes.
# CONFIG_CC_OPTIMIZE_FOR_PERFORMANCE is not set
CONFIG_CC_OPTIMIZE_FOR_PERFORMANCE_O3=y
